Usage: opencli list [options] [query]

Find available capabilities; inspect a command with --help -f json

Arguments:
  query               Filter command names and descriptions

Options:
  --site <site>       Only adapters for this site
  --limit <n>         Maximum results (1–100) (default: 25)
  --offset <n>        Start offset from the previous result (default: 0)
  -f, --format <fmt>  json, table, yaml, md, csv (default: "json")
  -h, --help          display help for command
